🚀 AI-Powered Complaint Management System

An intelligent full-stack MERN application that automates complaint categorization, priority detection, and real-time status tracking using AI.

📌 Overview

The AI Complaint Management System is a smart grievance redressal platform designed to streamline complaint handling through AI-driven analysis and role-based dashboards.

The system allows users to submit complaints with images, automatically analyzes them using AI, assigns priority levels, and enables administrators to monitor and resolve issues efficiently.

🧠 Key Features

🤖 AI-based complaint categorization

⚡ Automatic priority detection (High / Normal)

📊 Admin dashboard with filtering & analytics

🔄 Real-time complaint status tracking

🔐 JWT-based secure authentication

👥 Role-based access control (User / Admin)

📷 Image upload support

📦 RESTful API architecture

